  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Hello!</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Nice to meet you.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">My name is Adam Pearson.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">I am one of the owners of Fortunato Chocolate.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">You can learn more about our company here, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.fortunatochocolate.com\" rel=\"noopener\">www.fortunatochocolate.com</a>.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We've been buying a thought to be extinct variety of cacao in the northern Peruvian jungle for going on 16 years.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">This particular heirloom variety of cacao makes very delicious chocolate, and our project has helped improve the lives of more than 500 small-hold cacao farmers.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We are looking for creators in the food and drink category to collaborate with us and help share our brand story.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(48, 48, 48); font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 450; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: #303030; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, San Francisco, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We'll pay you 20% of every sale you help us generate.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #303030; font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, San Francisco, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Thank you so much for considering us!<br><br>Adam</span></span></p>",
